{"id":"4b4cc773d6acdba5","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-prop-limits-colimits.md","title":"Limits and Colimits","display":"prop-limits-colimits — Limits and Colimits","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-limits-colimits","aliases":["58-prop-limits-colimits"],"display":"prop-limits-colimits — Limits and Colimits","depends_on":["[[58-df-category]]","[[58-df-functor]]","[[58-df-universal-cone]]","[[58-df-colimit]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-limits-colimits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-limits-colimits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-limits-colimits — Limits and Colimits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e56495c9794b9dd7\" href=\"?note=e56495c9794b9dd7\" title=\"58-df-universal-cone\">58-df-universal-cone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5e64f0c882e3eee\" href=\"?note=d5e64f0c882e3eee\" title=\"58-df-colimit\">58-df-colimit</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C,L,K,\\pi,\\iota\\in V\">\\(D,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C,L,K,\\pi,\\iota\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e56495c9794b9dd7\" href=\"?note=e56495c9794b9dd7\" title=\"58-df-universal-cone\">58-df-universal-cone</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Colimit}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Colimit}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5e64f0c882e3eee\" href=\"?note=d5e64f0c882e3eee\" title=\"58-df-colimit\">58-df-colimit</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}limits\\text{-}colimits}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\n\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,F,L,\\pi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\n\\to\\exists K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,F,K,\\iota)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists L,\\pi,K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,D,L,\\pi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,D,K,\\iota)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}limits\\text{-}colimits}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\n\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,F,L,\\pi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\n\\to\\exists K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,F,K,\\iota)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists L,\\pi,K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,D,L,\\pi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,D,K,\\iota)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion is the specialization to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> of the two displayed existence hypotheses, using the exact five-place predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li>Products, pullbacks, equalizers are limits; coproducts, pushouts, coequalizers are colimits.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-universal-cone","status":"resolved","id":"e56495c9794b9dd7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-universal-cone]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-colimit","status":"resolved","id":"d5e64f0c882e3eee","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-colimit]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-universal-cone","status":"resolved","id":"e56495c9794b9dd7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-universal-cone]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-colimit","status":"resolved","id":"d5e64f0c882e3eee","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Colimit}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-colimit]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C,L,K,\\pi,\\iota\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Colimit}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}limits\\text{-}colimits}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\n\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,F,L,\\pi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall F\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)\n\\to\\exists K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,F,K,\\iota)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists L,\\pi,K,\\iota\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,D,L,\\pi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal J,D,K,\\iota)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":1656,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3977","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-prop-limits-colimits.md|58-prop-limits-colimits]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a87b7e1119b63b2c","877f1061e295cf5f","e56495c9794b9dd7","d5e64f0c882e3eee"]}